    "value": "PREFIX sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#>\n\n\n\n\n\nSELECT ?p  (count(*) as ?eff) WHERE {\n    graph ?g {\n    ?s a sh:NodeShape;\n      ?p ?o\n\n    }\n}\ngroup by ?p\norder by desc(?eff)\nlimit 10",
